### Backend (6 file)

| File | Cambiamento |
|------|-------------|
| [\_\_init\_\_.py](file:///d:/tender/tenderwriter/backend/app/models/__init__.py) | Nuovo modello [TenderPermission](file:///d:/tender/tenderwriter/backend/app/models/__init__.py#257-272) + relazioni su [User](file:///d:/tender/tenderwriter/frontend/src/api/client.ts#161-167) e [Tender](file:///d:/tender/tenderwriter/backend/app/models/__init__.py#120-143) |
